on":"窦妙，中国东汉时期皇族女性，为汉桓帝第三任皇后，是汉章帝皇后窦氏堂兄弟的孙女，父窦武。","link_td_id":"Q10007639","link_td_number_id":815261,"people_name":"竇太后","people_name_jianti_auto":"窦太后","people_xingming":"窦妙","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9767104e-db0e-11ef-b79a-a0d3651f611f","wl_zhushi":"[窦妙]"},{"people_name":"董萌","people_name_jianti_auto":"董萌","people_xingming":"董萌","start_index":39,"tongjian_id":"97671050-db0e-11ef-91c3-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":181,"link_td_description":"曹节，字汉丰，南阳郡新野县人，是汉灵帝时有权势的宦官，曾参与诛杀窦武、陈蕃。","link_td_id":"Q10007381","link_td_number_id":457162,"people_name":"曹節","people_name_jianti_auto":"曹节","people_xingming":"曹节","start_index":65,"tongjian_id":"97671051-db0e-11ef-bb5f-a0d3651f611f"},{"link_death_year":179,"link_td_description":"王甫，东汉灵帝时的宦官。","link_td_id":"Q10002060","link_td_number_id":1056075,"people_name":"王甫","people_name_jianti_auto":"王甫","people_xingming":"王甫","start_index":68,"tongjian_id":"97671052-db0e-11ef-8ceb-a0d3651f611f"},{"people_name":"萌","people_name_jianti_auto":"萌","people_xingming":"董萌","start_index":74,"tongjian_id":"97671053-db0e-11ef-abbe-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[{"note_on_table":"ZZTJContent","note_on_tongjian_id":"97671047-db0e-11ef-8436-a0d3651f611f","pinyin":"shàn","source_anchor_text":"誣萌以謗訕永樂宮下","source_key":"baiyang_epub","start_index":77,"text":"訕","tongjian_id":"cd71c5f5-5cbb-5331-8666-11b59bb2a835"}],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"南宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"南宫","resolved_place_entity_id":842,"start_index":28,"tongjian_id":"9767104f-db0e-11ef-b598-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"永樂宮","place_name_jianti_auto":"永乐宫","resolved_place_entity_id":2682,"start_index":78,"tongjian_id":"97671054-db0e-11ef-891d-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["权争"],"content":"9帝以竇太后有援立之功，冬，十月，戊子朔，率羣臣朝太后於南宮，親饋上壽。黃門令董萌因此數爲太后訴冤，帝深納之，供養資奉，有加於前。曹節、王甫疾之，誣萌以謗訕永樂宮，下獄死。","content_fanyi":"灵帝因为窦太后有扶立自己登上帝位的功劳，冬季，十月戊子朔这一天，率领朝廷百官到南宫朝见窦太后，亲自进献食物并祝寿。黄门令董萌趁此机会多次替窦太后申诉冤屈，灵帝深为采纳他的意见，对窦太后的供养和财物供给比以往有所增加。曹节、王甫因此痛恨董萌，便诬陷他诽谤住在永乐宫的灵帝生母董太后，把他投入监狱处死。","content_jianti_auto":"9帝以窦太后有援立之功，冬，十月，戊子朔，率群臣朝太后于南宫，亲馈上寿。黄门令董萌因此数为太后诉冤，帝深纳之，供养资奉，有加于前。曹节、王甫疾之，诬萌以谤讪永乐宫，下狱死。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4838,"number":9,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":8,"tongjian_id":"97671047-db0e-11ef-8436-a0d3651f611f"},{"ExtRef_Children_books":[],"ExtRef_Children_companion_annotation_entities":[],"ExtRef_Children_decisions":[],"ExtRef_Children_hu_notes":[],"ExtRef_Children_officials":[],"ExtRef_Children_people":[],"ExtRef_Children_pinyin":[],"ExtRef_Children_places":[{"place_name":"鮮卑","place_name_jianti_auto":"鲜卑","resolved_place_entity_id":218,"start_index":2,"tongjian_id":"97671056-db0e-11ef-b5c5-a0d3651f611f"},{"place_name":"幷州","place_name_jianti_auto":"幷州","resolved_place_entity_id":186,"start_index":5,"tongjian_id":"97671057-db0e-11ef-8583-a0d3651f611f"}],"ExtRef_Children_topics":[{"title":"东汉与鲜卑的战争","tongjian_id":"war_N0613"}],"ExtRef_Children_user_annotation_entities":[],"background_material_references":[],"class_tags":["军事"],"content":"10鮮卑寇幷州。","content_fanyi":"鲜卑人进犯并州。","content_jianti_auto":"10鲜卑寇幷州。","dtjl_paragraph_links":[],"dtjl_references":[],"id":4839,"number":10,"reading_annotation_sources":[],"start_index":9,"tongjian_id":"97671055-db0e-11ef-bff7-a0d3651f611f"}],"reign_name":"四年","reign_name_jianti_auto":"四年","start_index":3,"tongjian_id":"9764d9fa-db0e-11ef-a1e1-a0d3651f611f","year_anno":"（辛亥、一七一）","year_int":171},"message":"success","success":true}